  "behavior": [
    "Support pacing uses a same-tick snapshot, remains local to the same lane and owner, and never changes the saved Speed stat.",
    "Supports advance at normal speed when unaccompanied and do not slow each other; deployment holds, fleeing and retreat do not count as protective screens.",
    "Tumler does not stop or swing at incidental enemies while hunting. Existing Kurchin taunts and hostile walls remain effective.",
    "Evasion is seeded independently per attacker, target, tick and attack kind. Successful dodges prevent HP/Armor loss and on-hit effects.",
    "Target contact, an unavailable target, immobility, birth hold, waiting, retreat and forced fleeing disable hunting evasion.",
    "A landed melee hit changes the persistent hunt target even if Armor absorbs it. Ranged attacks leave the hunt target unchanged.",
    "Muno strikes and Dotra ambushes can intercept. Beams and Kopita pulses can be evaded without interception. Existing poison cannot be evaded.",
    "A brief dodge streak is derived from authoritative attack events; evaded beam/pulse damage does not display a successful hit flash."
